      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1793633778819,
      "created": 1793458519377,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "A catastral reference can have many lots associated (because it may appear in subsequent rounds)\n\nA lot can have many catastral references\n\n- Catastral references and lots have a many-to-many relationship that is modeled using a junction table.\n\nA lot belongs to exactly one auction\n\nAn auction have many lots",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "A catastral reference can have many lots associated (because it may appear in subsequent rounds)\n\nA lot can have many catastral references\n\n- Catastral references and lots have a many-to-many relationship that is modeled using a junction table.\n\nA lot belongs to exactly one auction\n\nAn auction have many lots",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
